<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><i>Sponsored by <strong>Gamut Podcast Network</strong>. Want top 10 network reach and a team that actually emails you back? Gamut does both. If your show should be making more money, let’s talk. Email dan@gamutpodcasts.com or <a class="l" style="font-weight:bold;color:#BC1515" href="https://podnews.net/class-click/3849/2026-11-26">visit Gamut Podcast Network</a></i></p><ul>
<li>&quot;Would you like to be interviewed by a famous podcaster? That'll be $260, please.&quot; It's a scam, of course - and <a href="https://www.aihosts.fm/podcast-guest-scams?utm_source=podnews.net&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=podnews.net%3A2026-11-26">Bo Bennett has received at least five invitations like this, presenting themselves as podcast hosts or radio interviewers, but asking for sometimes fantastical sums of money</a>. Be thankful to Bo today - he has written a full article on how the scams work, what to look for, and what to check.</li>
<li><a href="https://fountain.fm/blog/introducing-daily-growth?utm_source=podnews.net&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=podnews.net%3A2026-11-26">Fountain has added plugins for Claude and ChatGPT, and launched a tool called Daily Growth</a>: a system that reads the news for the day, checks your archive to see if you've any content that is relevant, clips it and sends it to you for approval to post to your socials. It works on any podcast, wherever it's hosted.</li>
<li>In London, <a href="https://podnews.net/press-release/st-ermins-podcaster-in-residence">St. Ermin's Hotel has opened a podcast studio, called The Listening Station</a> - and has announced a Podcaster In Residence programme, offering a month's access to the Westminster studio. <a href="https://podnews.net/press-release/st-ermins-podcaster-in-residence">You can learn more details and apply</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li>The hotel has also provided the Independent Podcast Awards an exclusive recording package for the winner - including an overnight stay and a full day's studio access.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul><p><a href="https://podnews.net/update/fake-interviews-scam"><B>&gt; &gt; &gt; Read more of today’s podcast industry news stories on the Podnews website</b></a>: and get our free daily newsletter.</p><P><B>Classifieds</B> - <a href="https://podnews.net/classifieds/">your job or ad here</a></P><ul><li><a href="https://podnews.net/class-click/3483/2026-11-26" rel="sponsored">Think it. Talk it. Script it. Podnami.com</a> &mdash; Start with a conversation, not a blank page. Talk through ideas with AI co-hosts, then turn it into a structured script instantly or enter an idea and a script will be created for you.</li></ul></P><P><B>Gold supporters:</B> <a href="https://www.buzzsprout.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Buzzsprout</a>, <a href="https://mowpod.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Mowpod</a>, <a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Beehiiv</a>, <a href="https://www.podbean.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Podbean</a>, <a href="https://100mba.net/escape/?utm_source=partners&utm_medium=leadgen&utm_content=Podnews&utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">The $100 MBA</a>, <a href="https://podglomerate.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">The Podglomerate</a>, <a href="https://cloud10.fm/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Cloud10</a>, <a href="https://www.contentcreatorsaccountant.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">The Content Creator's Accountant</a>, <a href="https://simplecast.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Simplecast</a>, <a href="https://podprotect.net/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">PodProtect - podcast identity pr</a>, <a href="https://podscribe.com/?utm_source=podnews.net&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=supporter">Podscribe</a>, <